{"about_the_game":"Swarm Queen is a <strong>quick-to-learn</strong>, <strong>tactical</strong>, and <strong>challenging</strong> tug-of-war strategy game about insect-like aliens battling over Jupiter's moon, Europa.<br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/e3d2fa8576fc353b533c0eebd22c6167.webp?t=1752875429\" width=357 height=25 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/fcd4764610cc1caab4a5b2545e7ecd48.poster.avif?t=1752875429\" width=188 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/fcd4764610cc1caab4a5b2545e7ecd48.webm?t=1752875429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/fcd4764610cc1caab4a5b2545e7ecd48.mp4?t=1752875429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/58415f83107f6611a00060607fbb1cde.avif?t=1752875429\" width=122 height=150 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/54972d15c191278498ac558be1c84ad8.poster.avif?t=1752875429\" width=254 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/54972d15c191278498ac558be1c84ad8.webm?t=1752875429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/54972d15c191278498ac558be1c84ad8.mp4?t=1752875429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your minions <strong>control themselves</strong>, using &quot;fuzzy logic&quot; to pick the best target.<br><br>Since your swarm fights on its own, your job as the queen is to focus on <strong>strategy</strong>.<br><br><strong>Gather resources</strong> with &quot;Harvester&quot; units, <strong>mutate your eggs</strong> into new types of minions, <strong>build your army</strong>, and spit globs of <i>Neurotoxin</i> at the enemy horde while the battle rages on.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/caaf82f5d3df424b0f8b7034f2311a93.poster.avif?t=1752875429\" width=392 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/caaf82f5d3df424b0f8b7034f2311a93.webm?t=1752875429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/caaf82f5d3df424b0f8b7034f2311a93.mp4?t=1752875429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/0ef3ff3125a789e35b575ee1313f9833.avif?t=1752875429\" width=158 height=70 /></span><br>In the biggest update yet, version 2.0 includes an <strong>alternate &quot;cartoon&quot; art style</strong>, <strong>Steam achievements</strong>, visible enemy &quot;<strong>emotions</strong>&quot;, an &quot;easy&quot; <strong>difficulty setting</strong>, and <strong>more</strong>!<br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/6420fabeb4cd46fbdba8ad1188bbdd59.poster.avif?t=1752875429\" width=236 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/6420fabeb4cd46fbdba8ad1188bbdd59.webm?t=1752875429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/6420fabeb4cd46fbdba8ad1188bbdd59.mp4?t=1752875429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/a6f95fda39925a182760d1a4d7dc89e7.webp?t=1752875429\" width=413 height=33 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/f866527073eb96c8d206bf2ca0f5b2aa.webp?t=1752875429\" width=631 height=50 /></span><br>Build your army out of 18 different minions, from <strong>electricity-shooting shell-covered beasts</strong>, to <strong>flying bat-like bomb-carriers</strong>, each with their own strengths and weaknesses.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/92f08a535cde7aaee0bb620ec8bd9516.webp?t=1752875429\" width=468 height=57 /></span><br>Unlock new creatures and abilities as you play through <strong>dozens of levels</strong>, including bonus &quot;<strong>challenge levels</strong>&quot; which put a twist on the normal gameplay. For a tough battle, replay levels on <strong>hard mode</strong>, or try the &quot;<strong>New Game Plus</strong>&quot; mode added in a free update.<br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/0bd9b1246549a7d161ae4094338e2620.poster.avif?t=1752875429\" width=300 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/0bd9b1246549a7d161ae4094338e2620.webm?t=1752875429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/0bd9b1246549a7d161ae4094338e2620.mp4?t=1752875429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/788c497bb2e892e23293f198ac082a2b.poster.avif?t=1752875429\" width=466 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/788c497bb2e892e23293f198ac082a2b.webm?t=1752875429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/788c497bb2e892e23293f198ac082a2b.mp4?t=1752875429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/baece74f0a3f2196ffc6b2d07e91b3d3.poster.avif?t=1752875429\" width=136 height=66 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/baece74f0a3f2196ffc6b2d07e91b3d3.webm?t=1752875429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/baece74f0a3f2196ffc6b2d07e91b3d3.mp4?t=1752875429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Swarm Queen is inspired by <strong>insects</strong>, and classic sci-fi aliens like Xenomorphs, Zerg, and the &quot;Bugs&quot; from Starship Troopers. It's like a war between ant colonies.. but <i>in space!</i><br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/128a51def89c5c15a8643c4f501eb0a6.poster.avif?t=1752875429\" width=390 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/128a51def89c5c15a8643c4f501eb0a6.webm?t=1752875429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/128a51def89c5c15a8643c4f501eb0a6.mp4?t=1752875429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/e7233a6ca307cf4c485c1a51b6a571cb.poster.avif?t=1752875429\" width=90 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/e7233a6ca307cf4c485c1a51b6a571cb.webm?t=1752875429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/e7233a6ca307cf4c485c1a51b6a571cb.mp4?t=1752875429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Swarm Queen contains a &quot;100% scientifically accurate&quot; depiction of Jupiter's moon Europa, including all of the alien life. No, it's not covered in ice. NASA is lying to you.<br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/550b4c7481017328bdf466bb34c708ce.webp?t=1752875429\" width=135 height=23 /></span><br><strong>Swarm Queen</strong> is a one-man indie project and first commercial release from Canadian developer Helmi Bastami, formerly a hobbyist animator and creator of Flash games on Flyborg\u00a0.\u00a0net","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pro-Gaming Master ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/701870/67b6c148e70341c5d6bb88f7744ec558c5fd9133.jpg"},{"name":"Murder! :D","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/701870/c35c4fcbb8410f75bb145b444a931712c143935c.jpg"},{"name":"Mass Murder, Haha! :D","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/701870/8bbed973f20e66e6ec5e52aa28d35827945609d8.jpg"},{"name":"Serious War Crime. Not Funny. :|","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/701870/15bfd2951e19419f93ec4d0093e434626a709dd1.jpg"},{"name":"Small Army","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/701870/c2c6afc69bb41469f81b4f6675543710f1ecbc91.jpg"},{"name":"That's a Lot of Space Bugs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/701870/4ab724a05945b3215602d61f7add6c093cb5be83.jpg"},{"name":"Actual Swarm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/701870/1685133c2974dfdcd28fa1aa72d80d1b26b0b104.jpg"},{"name":"Collect 10,000 Nectar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/701870/07cadc05458fecb3341e1accb40957e2f962110c.jpg"},{"name":"Collect 100,000 Nectar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/701870/d9b892eb64db7808170d14fe618cd5ab8d104314.jpg"},{"name":"Collect 1,000,000 Nectar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/701870/69453a0dc7c1f239c75d41541effe0dc3c42a5b4.jpg"}],"total":55},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/701870?t=1752875429","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752875429","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/4bfc9ade66a8dae8d6a6c6afd712f688bf4726c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752875429","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/4bfc9ade66a8dae8d6a6c6afd712f688bf4726c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752875429","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Swarm Queen is a <strong>quick-to-learn</strong>, <strong>tactical</strong>, and <strong>challenging</strong> tug-of-war strategy game about insect-like aliens battling over Jupiter's moon, Europa.<br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701870/extras/e3d2fa8576fc353b533c0eebd22c6167.webp?t=1752875429\" width=357 height=25 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cla